title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (pragmatist_dissent > 30 and not pragmatists_left) or (emali_dissent > 30 and not emali_left) or (oldleft_dissent > 30 and not bsw_split) or (beweli_dissent > 30 and not beweli_left))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/Reichstagsfraktion_der_SPD.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if pragmatist_dissent > 30 : The Pragmatists are upset at our direction.  ?]
[? if emali_dissent > 30 : The Centrists are displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if beweli_dissent > 30 : The Movement Left disagree with our present course of action. ?]
[? if oldleft_dissent > 30: Old Leftists are making noises about a party split. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_pragmatist
- @concessions_emali
- @concessions_oldleft
- @concessions_beweli
- @do_nothing
- @easy_discard

@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: beweli_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/4; emali_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/4; pragmatist_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/4; oldleft_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/4; urban_linke -= (dissent * 7); east_linke -= (dissent * 4); youth_linke -= (dissent * 4)

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_pragmatist
title: Give concessions to the moderates.
view-if: pragmatist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: pragmatist_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/2.5; beweli_dissent += 7; oldleft_dissent += 4;


@concessions_emali
title: Give concessions to the centrists.
view-if: emali_dissent > 30
on-arrival: emali_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/2.5; oldleft_dissent += 7;


@concessions_oldleft
title: Give concessions to the populist left.
view-if: oldleft_dissent > 30
on-arrival: oldleft_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/2.5; beweli_dissent += 5; pragmatist_dissent += 7;


@concessions_beweli
title: Give concessions to the Bewegungslinke.
view-if: beweli_dissent > 30
on-arrival: beweli_dissent -= (28-decentralization)/2.5; pragmatist_dissent += 7; oldleft_dissent += 4;


@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: oldleft_dissent += 1; beweli_dissent += 1; emali_dissent += 1; pragmatist_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.

@expel_labor
title: Expel the labor supporters.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
